      "writtenOn": "2026-02-04T15:32:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I think we should push for more clang as the preferred compiler. I\u0027ve repeatedly seen significant performance regressions with MSVC, even on the GPU configs where you\u0027d expect less chance for a CPU bottleneck.\n\nGiven that, we should only really be treating MSVC like we do gcc, an FYI make sure we don\u0027t break it, but maybe not really care about performance.",
